      "solution": "Answer: ride"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9",
      "type": "text",
      "question": "A rabbit can ___. (hop or hops)",
      "answer": "hop",
      "solution": "Answer: hop"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10",
      "type": "text",
      "question": "Complete: Yes, I ___. (can or am)",
      "answer": "can",
      "solution": "Answer: can"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Use can to say what someone is able to do and cannot to say what they are not able to do.",
